5,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Since it's the first day, we have no information yet. Let's keep our observations sharp. I'm looking forward to seeing how everyone behaves as the discussion progresses. Does anyone have a strategy they'd like to suggest?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"I'm so excited to play! Maybe we can all share something we're thinking? Or we could play a little game to see who's acting nervous! Hehe, let's just have fun and find the wolf!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Toshio,,"Let's stay focused. While Sakura's enthusiasm is noted, we should prioritize logical deduction over games. I suggest we observe how people react to accusations and contradictions as the days progress.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Toshio. A calm and observant approach is best. Let us listen to one another and see what patterns emerge. I am happy to follow the lead of the group.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm in! This sounds like a huge adventure! I'll do my best to help everyone find the werewolf. Let's all be honest and work together so we can win! Who's excited?,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"It seems we are all in agreement on the importance of observation. @Sakura and @Kenji, your energy is great, but let's ensure it doesn't cloud our judgment. I'll be watching for any inconsistencies in our logic.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Mizuki, you're so serious! But I'll be super careful, I promise! I'm just curious to see who's hiding a secret. Maybe the wolf is trying to act all calm and quiet? Hehe!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"Possibility is always there, Sakura. However, acting ""calm"" is not evidence of guilt. We should avoid jumping to conclusions based on personality traits and instead focus on the information we gather.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,Indeed. Let us not mistake a quiet nature for a hidden agenda. It is more productive to analyze the flow of information than to judge a person's temperament. I will remain observant.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, I'll be super careful, I promise! I just want us all to get along while we solve this mystery. @Toshio, you're right! I'll focus on the clues and not just my gut feeling!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Since we've established our general approach, let's consider the Seer's role. The first divination happens tonight. @everyone, please be mindful of how you respond tomorrow; the Seer's information will be our most valuable asset.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"Ooh, the Seer! I wonder who it is? Maybe they'll find something super spooky tonight! @everyone, if you're the Seer, please be really careful who you pick! I can't wait to hear what happens tomorrow! Hehe!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"The Seer must be strategic. Revealing themselves too early makes them a target for the werewolf. For now, it is best that the Seer remains hidden while they gather the first piece of evidence.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,I concur with Toshio. The Seer's safety is paramount to our success. It is wiser to let the truth emerge gradually than to risk losing our most precious source of information too soon.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Kenji,,That's a great point! We have to protect the Seer like a secret treasure! I'll be watching out for anyone who seems too mean or suspicious. Let's all stay safe tonight!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,We've set a solid foundation for our approach. Let's end the day here and wait for tomorrow's developments. I'll be analyzing everyone's reactions once the first results are in. Good luck to the Seer tonight.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Sakura,,"Good luck to the Seer too! I hope you find something really interesting! I'm going to go dream about catching the wolf! Bye-bye everyone, see you tomorrow! Hehe!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Sakura,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Toshio,,I agree. Let us proceed to the night phase. I will be observing everyone's behavior closely tomorrow to see if any contradictions arise. Good night.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,I wish you all a peaceful night. May the Seer's vision be clear and our community remain safe. I look forward to our discussion tomorrow.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Kenji,,"Good night, everyone! I'm going to sleep now so I can be full of energy for tomorrow! Let's all have sweet dreams and wake up ready to solve this! See you all tomorrow!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
