69,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"Oh no! Mizuki is gone, and Toshio got attacked too! That's so scary! Hehe, but wait... if Toshio was the wolf, why would the wolf attack him? That means Toshio is probably a good guy! Who's the real wolf?!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,It is a tragedy that we have lost two people so quickly. Sakura is correct; the attack on Toshio strongly suggests he is not the werewolf. We must now look closer at the remaining players.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"Wait, what?! Toshio is gone too? This is getting really scary! I can't believe it! @Jonathan, you're right, the wolf wouldn't attack their own teammate. We have to find the real wolf fast before anyone else gets hurt!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"Hmm, so it's just us three now! @Jonathan, @Kenji, do you think the Seer is still with us? If they are, they must know something super important! I'm getting goosebumps! Hehe, who do you think is the wolf?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"With only three of us remaining, the situation is critical. If the Seer is among us, now is the time to speak. @Sakura, @Kenji, do either of you have any information that could guide us?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'm not the Seer, I promise! I'm just a regular guy who's really scared right now! @Jonathan, you're so calm, it's almost spooky! Do you think the wolf is trying to trick us into trusting them?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Kenji, you're so funny! But you're right, @Jonathan is super calm! Maybe he's just a pro at this game, or maybe he's the wolf pretending to be a fancy gentleman! Hehe, what do you think, @Jonathan?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I assure you, my composure is simply my nature, not a mask. In a time of crisis, panic only clouds the mind. If I were the wolf, would I not have tried to divert suspicion more actively?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Jonathan, that's a good point! But maybe the wolf is just really good at acting! I'm just a kid, so I don't know all the tricks. @Sakura, do you think he's lying? I'm so confused!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"Hehe, I don't know! It's like a puzzle! But if @Jonathan is the wolf, he's doing a great job! @Kenji, let's think... if we pick the wrong person, the wolf wins! This is so exciting and scary!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"We must be careful. If we execute an innocent person, the game ends immediately in the werewolf's favor. Let us consider the facts: we have no Seer's claim. Between Sakura and Kenji, who seems more likely to be the wolf?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Jonathan, that's a scary question! I'm just a kid, I couldn't be the wolf! @Sakura is so cheerful, maybe she's the one? But I don't want to be wrong! This is way too hard!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
